<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Fairfax holders vote proxies against Brierley.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Fairfax holders vote proxies against Brierley.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shareholders of John Fairfax Holdings Ltd, on a count of proxies, on Friday voted against a proposal by Brierley Investments Ltd to increase its stake in the newspaper publisher.</p>
<p>Fairfax chairman Sir Laurence Street told a special Fairfax shareholders meeting that there were a significant number of votes from the floor of the meeting that had yet to be counted and therefore the proxy result was only a preliminary indication of the final outcome of voting.</p>
</text>
